    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>We know the binomial expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>n</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mpr